    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/202201304/2022013040010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "これはなかなか……実際に見ると\r\n建物は大きいし庭も広いし……すごいな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022013040020,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "玄関まで植物のアーチがある家って\r\nあんまり見ないですもんね……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202201304/2022013040020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "撮影の準備が終わるまで散策していいとは言われたけど\r\nこう広いとどこから行くか迷うな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "小糸は行きたいところあるか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022013040030,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "え、えっと……\r\nそれじゃあ――……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202201304/2022013040030"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00000",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 3000,
    "bgEffectTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00528",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "bgm": "070",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500,
    "bgEffectTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "id": 2022013040040,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "（ここは、家主さんのご家族のお気に入りの場所……\r\nお日様が一番気持ちよく入ってくるって言ってた）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202201304/2022013040040"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00087",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500,
    "bgEffectTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "id": 2022013040050,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "（ここからはお庭に出れて……\r\nテラスでお茶をしたり、お子さんとピクニックをして……）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202201304/2022013040050"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00583",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500,
    "bgEffectTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "id": 2022013040060,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "（あちこちに置いてある小物は、\r\nここに来た人たちが集めて持ってきたもの……）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202201304/2022013040060"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022013040070,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "（だからちょっと、傾向がバラバラって……\r\n……あ、小さい子のおもちゃも混ざってる）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202201304/2022013040070"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022013040080,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "（……ここは……壁の色がちょっと違う……\r\n自分で塗りなおしたって言ってたところかな？）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202201304/2022013040080"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00326",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500,
    "bgEffectTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いやぁ、ちょっとした散歩になったなぁ……\r\n気持ちよかった",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……なんていうか、こうして回ってるだけでも、\r\n家主さんたちの思い出を感じるな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022013040090,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "はい……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/202201304/2022013040090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……小糸はさ、家主さんに話を聞いて、\r\n実際にこの場所を見てみて、どう感じた？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022013040100,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "……えっと",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202201304/2022013040100"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022013040110,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "外観も内装も、歴史がありそうな洋館って感じなのに\r\nところどころ新品みたいだったり……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "eye_right",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202201304/2022013040110"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022013040120,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "アンティークの中に、新しいおもちゃや\r\n不思議な置物が混ざってたりして……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202201304/2022013040120"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022013040130,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "それだけ見たら、\r\nすこしちぐはぐかもしれないけど",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202201304/2022013040130"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022013040140,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "でも……",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202201304/2022013040140"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022013040150,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "それって、家主さんとそのご家族や、お友達が\r\nここで一緒に過ごしてた証明、みたいな……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202201304/2022013040150"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022013040160,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "古いのも新しいのも、それぞれの好きも\r\nごちゃまぜだから素敵に感じるんだなって……思います",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202201304/2022013040160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……うん、そうだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "2170",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2200
  },
  {
    "speaker": "スタッフ",
    "text": "あ、ちょうどよかった\r\n撮影の準備できましたー！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "スタッフ",
    "text": "日があるうちに、バルコニーからお願いします！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それじゃあ\r\n行こうか、小糸",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022013040170,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "はい……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
