    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "speaker": "スタッフ",
    "text": "最初の写真は外から撮るので\r\nそこの窓からバルコニーに出てもらえたら",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "スタッフ",
    "text": "では、映りのテストを行いますので\r\n一旦窓付近で自由に動いてみてください",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022013040180,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "は、はい……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202201304/2022013040180"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00087",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "se": "1685",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1600,
    "bgEffectTime": 700
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0098",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2600
  },
  {
    "id": 2022013040190,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202201304/2022013040190"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022013040200,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "（びっくりした……）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202201304/2022013040200"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022013040210,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "（こんな近くに鳥……\r\nそれに全然、逃げない……？）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202201304/2022013040210"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022013040220,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "（もしかして、元からここの庭に住んでるのかな\r\n家主さんたちと、一緒に……）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202201304/2022013040220"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022013040230,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "（だとしたら、この子たちにとっても、ここは――）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202201304/2022013040230"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022013040240,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "お家、なのかな――……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202201304/2022013040240"
  },
